      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The official would likely frame the workers as inherently suited for manual labor due to their \"natural disposition\" towards physical tasks, suggesting intellectual pursuits are beyond their capacity. They might argue that the complex systems of governance require a refined, educated mind, which the lower classes simply lack the aptitude for. Furthermore, they could claim that granting them autonomy would lead to chaos and inefficiency, painting them as inherently volatile and incapable of self-governance. This narrative positions their subjugation not as oppression, but as a necessary societal structure for optimal function.",
