      "content": "that makes sense. it's more chilling if it sounds like \"common sense\" to them. can you actually try writing a draft of a short speech? like, maybe the official is talking to a group of young elites? i want to see how they'd actually phrase things—instead of just saying \"they are workers,\" maybe they use descriptions that make them sound more like a different species or just biological tools, to really drive home that they shouldn't be treated like equals.",
